Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.0.4~template1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: Isolated iOS16 jailbreak test of a real CPTemplateApplicationScene navigation callback (CarPlay-issued CPWindow) plus legacy generic UIKit scene role. Own blank test scene only; not yet a two-app bridge or a verified CarPlay Home icon. Existing system Dock remains OS-owned. No vendor code. No automatic respring.
